<title>JAPAN: Toyo Seikan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyo Seikan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		279.21		vs	  285.56</p>
<p> Operating	   11.66		vs	   17.55</p>
<p> Current	     12.60		vs	   19.23</p>
<p> Net		    6.32		vs	   10.98</p>
<p> EPS		   31.34 yen	  vs	   54.45 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    202 million	  vs	 202 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyo Seikan Kaisha Ltd is a major can manufacturer.</p>
</text>
